# ConfirmGate (OneAquaHealth)

This repo is Track 3 observation integrity for the OneAquaHealth IEEE Global Hackathon only.

- Authority: `docs/CONFIRMGATE-ARCHITECTURE-SPIKE.md`, then `docs/PHASE1-AUDIT.md`.
- Devpost deadline: 4 Oct 2026 9:00 PM PDT (5 Oct 2026 09:30 IST). Judging 5–15 Oct; winners 24 Oct at IEEE iGET. Keep the live URL up through judging.
- Human confirm is authority. AI optional (NullAiAssist). FHIR only after finalize — never `preliminary`.
- Ship a deployed web app with `/upload`, confirm, `/fhir`. Not a notebook, not Streamlit-only.
- Cities: Coimbra, Benevento, Ghent, Oslo, Toulouse only.
- Do not build: trust scores, blockchain, Isolation Forest demos, CS-app replacement, photo→BMWP/pathogen, StreamWitness factsheet checklist thesis.
- Judging: Impact 30%, Innovation 20%, Technical 20%, UX 15%, Scale 15%. Video 3–5 min. Public GitHub. Commits on/after 14 Sep 2026.
- Read `AGENTS.md` and the ConfirmGate spike before expanding scope.
